Area and Volume 1|1.13|d2047497|369|C|mcq|-|What is the area of a rectangle with a length of 17 cm and a width of 7 cm?|24 cm^2;48 cm^2;119 cm^2;576 cm^2|A=l+w; B=2(l+w) (perimeter); C=l*w CORRECT; D=(l+w)^2 (perimeter-ish squared)
