Linear Functions 1|1.3|6863c7ce|424|C|mcq|-|d=16t gives distance d in inches after t seconds. Best interpretation of 16?|Object moved a total of 16 inches;Object moved a total of 16t inches;Object moves at 16 inches per second;Object moves at 1/16 inches per second|16 is the rate of change; A=treats it as a total; B=describes the whole expression; D=inverted the rate; C=CORRECT
Linear Functions 1|1.4|bf36c815|436|D|mcq|-|The function g is defined by g(x)=-x+8. What is the value of g(0)?|-8;0;4;8|Substitute 0 to get 8; A=sign error; B=evaluated the x term only; C=halved; D=CORRECT
Linear Functions 1|1.5|3f5375d9|671|A|mcq|line-graph-cab-cost|A graph of cab cost versus miles has y-intercept 3 and passes through (5,13). What is the cost for each additional mile?|2.00;2.60;3.00;5.00|Slope is (13-3)/5=2; B=divided the endpoint by the miles; C=gave the flat fee; D=misread; A=CORRECT
