Right Triangles and Trigonometry 1|1.4|bbaac300|413|A|mcq|-|Triangle ABC is similar to DEF with A corresponding to D and angles C and F right angles. If cos B=1/22, what is cos E?|1/22;1/23;21/22;22/23|Similar triangles have equal corresponding angles so B corresponds to E; A=CORRECT; B/C/D=treated the ratio as if it changed with scale
Right Triangles and Trigonometry 1|1.5|36661021|724|B|mcq|right-triangle-legs-9-6|A right triangle has legs 9 and 6 with hypotenuse c. Which is closest to the value of c?|7.5;10.8;15;58.5|sqrt(81+36)=sqrt117=10.8; A=averaged; C=added the legs; D=sum of squares without the root; B=CORRECT
Right Triangles and Trigonometry 2|2.1|902dc959|618|C|mcq|right-triangle-ABC-29-20-21|In right triangle ABC with right angle at C, AB=29, BC=20, AC=21. What is the value of tan A?|20/29;21/29;20/21;21/20|tan=opposite/adjacent=BC/AC; A=sin A; B=cos A; D=reciprocal (tan B); C=CORRECT
