Right Triangles and Trigonometry 2|2.6|13d9a1c3|315|4|spr|right-triangle-PQR-30|In right triangle PQR with right angle at P, QR=8 and angle R is 30 degrees. What is the length of PQ?|-|SPR: 8 sin30=4; error 4sqrt3 (used cosine)
