Linear Inequalities 1|1.14|f01ef454|439|C|mcq|-|A granite slab has volume greater than 12.7 and less than 15.7 cubic feet and weighs 165 pounds per cubic foot. Which inequality represents total weight x?|165-15.7<x<165-12.7;165+12.7<x<165+15.7;165(12.7)<x<165(15.7);165/15.7<x<165/12.7|Weight is density times volume; A/B=subtracted or added; D=divided; C=CORRECT
